::recipe
conversion stage: initial

name: Baked pasta with broccoli, boiled eggs and scamorza cheese
source: https://publicdomainrecipes.com/baked-pasta-with-broccoli/
source author: davide-costa
source license: Public domain (Unlicense)
ingredients: UK
units: metric
category: main
tags: pasta, broccoli, baked pasta
serves: 4
active time: ~15m
total time: ~45m
image: baked-pasta-with-broccoli.webp

::ingredients

(pasta) 500g
(broccoli) 500g
(egg) 4
(scamorza cheese, diced) 200g
(béchamel) 400g
(sage, optional) as needed
(parmesan cheese, optional) as needed
(salt) as needed
(black pepper) to taste

::equipment

(saucepan)
(pan)
(oven)

::instructions

(pasta) <boil, salted water>

Meanwhile [
    (broccoli) <boil, 10m>
    (egg) <boil, 10m>
    (scamorza cheese) <dice>
]

(oven) <heat, 180c>

Repeat [
    (pan) <layer, béchamel>
        <layer, pasta>
        <layer, broccoli + scamorza cheese + black pepper + salt>
]
until ingredients used

Optional [
    (sage) <add, top>
]

{pasta bake} <bake, 180c, 15-20m>
    <grill, 5-10m>

Optional [
    (parmesan cheese) <serve with>
]
